# Test fixtures must arrive byte for byte as they were committed.
#
# Without this, a checkout on Windows converts LF to CRLF for anything git
# considers text. The golden file is compared against output a Go encoder
# produced with LF endings, so the converted copy never matches and the test
# fails on Windows while passing on Linux and macOS — which is exactly how it
# was found.
testdata/** -text

# Disk images are binary and must never be touched.
*.dd binary
*.img binary
*.gz binary
